 "The modern banking system also has institutional arrangements to protect depositors' interests.",
 "Many countries have established deposit insurance: should a bank run into trouble, depositors' money remains protected up to a certain limit, which steadies people's minds and keeps them from rushing to withdraw all at once at the first sign of trouble.",
